  << /ActualText (I was blown away by the quality and style of the mid\055century modern armchair\041 The clean lines and sleek design are simply stunning\054 and the leather upholstery is incredibly soft and comfortable\056 The chair is also very versatile\054 as it can be easily incorporated into any room in the house\056\n\n\055  Larry Jonhson  \055\n)
